<title>USA: Deere &amp; Co Q2 April 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>Deere &amp; Co Q2 April 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MOLINE, Ill. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.25		    $1.04</p>
<p> Net			319,500		  272,700</p>
<p> Revs		   3,521,000		3,088,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 255,254		  262,199</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Revenues reflect total net sales and revenues and include equipment net sales of $3.108 billion vs $2.70 billion.  </p>
<p>Q2 equipment operating profit $474.0 million vs $384.0 million.</p>
<p>Q2 financial services operating profit $62.0 million vs $80.0 million.</p>
<p>		     SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.94		    $1.67</p>
<p> Net			496,200		  438,900</p>
<p> Revs		   5,917,000		5,406,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 255,254		  262,199</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Total net sales $5.110 billion vs $4.636 billion.</p>
<p>Equipment operating profit $711.0 million vs $605.0 million.</p>
<p>Financial services operating profit $129.0 million vs $155.0 million.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
